to men, women, and children

00:13:00.279 --> 00:13:03.248
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,
and other serious illnesses.

00:13:03.248 --> 00:13:04.716
And they need your help now
more than ever.

00:13:04.716 --> 00:13:07.219
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:13:07.219 --> 00:13:08.987
Stay safe.
Wash your hands.

00:13:08.987 --> 00:13:10.055
Wear a mask.
We love you.

